{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010If the game has display issues, you can try\u3011: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>restarting the game / creating a new save file / adjusting the ZOOM in settings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Our Demo is Now Available! Please add it to your wishlist if you like it! \u2764\ufe0f\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010You can contact us via the social links on the right side of the page for any feedback!\u3011</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Resort with Furry Friends!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with adorable animal buddies to create a one-of-a-kind vacation paradise! Attract all kinds of capybaras to chill, expand your resort, and grow it into a thriving empire. Don\u2019t worry\u2014this business won\u2019t hog your much time! Just set aside a little corner on your desktop, and boom\u2014your cute, quirky business adventure begins!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who\u2019s Coming?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our VIP guests? <strong>Capybaras who LOOOOOVE soaking!</strong> Every capybara has its own style and personality. Spice up your resort with diverse services to keep these fluffy VIP happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/de5f840004704cd6a5b8f941cfe8721c.poster.avif?t=1760511902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/de5f840004704cd6a5b8f941cfe8721c.apng?t=1760511902\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/01641980cc51c83db9735682fed2fdab.poster.avif?t=1760511902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/01641980cc51c83db9735682fed2fdab.apng?t=1760511902\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=180 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/8fce3e9b7fe1c47dc63cdd99e400d7c7.poster.avif?t=1760511902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/8fce3e9b7fe1c47dc63cdd99e400d7c7.apng?t=1760511902\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=180 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOOO Much Fun &amp; Relaxation!!!!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca6<strong>Bath Time Bliss</strong>: Soaking in hot springs is a capybara\u2019s favorite pastime! Warm water = Endless zen. Ahhh~</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/810dc3270120e17d5691f33d6ffac515.poster.avif?t=1760511902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/810dc3270120e17d5691f33d6ffac515.apng?t=1760511902\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1020 height=480 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf63<strong>Genius Chef Octopus</strong>: Meet Mr. Octo, the deep-sea culinary genius whipping up top-notch dishes!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/0dfd0b6f3d7fe2511aa8684dc4ee3c94.poster.avif?t=1760511902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/0dfd0b6f3d7fe2511aa8684dc4ee3c94.apng?t=1760511902\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1020 height=480 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e<strong>Cat Massage Therapy</strong>: Time for a &quot;paw-some&quot; massage! Let skilled kitty technicians knead those capybaras' worries away.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/d5f8b0f96113ab19333b39bceebc45d5.poster.avif?t=1760511902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/d5f8b0f96113ab19333b39bceebc45d5.apng?t=1760511902\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1020 height=480 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<i>And more activities to unlock!</i> Rack up glowing reviews from your clients, expand your services, and watch your resort shine!\u2728</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Dream Space!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the boss! Decorate every floor of your resort however you like\u2014cozy cottages, fancy suites\u2026 the choice is yours! Decorate more stunning rooms to attract more capybaras (and maybe you can unlock some quirky new furniture!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/63d8ff87188f8488a432e299a5991e1b.avif?t=1760511902\" width=1020 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/extras/7cae336bb30326f90f0388429aa91fc9.avif?t=1760511902\" width=1020 height=480 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Space!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>BIGGER &amp; BETTER!</strong> Gather resources to stack your resort breaking the sky. Beaver Foreman and his hardworking crew will hammer, see, and build you a towering masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute Staff, Zero Stress!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too busy? No problem! Your trusty animal pals will keep things running smoothly while you\u2019re off conquering the world (or your inbox).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play While You Work!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Capybara\u2019s Happy Life</i> sits cutely on your desktop! Resize it, move it, and manage your empire while tackling other tasks. Multi-task like a pro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Build?</strong> Don\u2019t just daydream\u2014grab your hard hat and let\u2019s get building! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\ud83d\udc96</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439470?t=1760511902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760511902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/17b3a2105dbcb83d3918fcf8c5641b1f526de006/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760511902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439470/17b3a2105dbcb83d3918fcf8c5641b1f526de006/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760511902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010If the game has display issues, you can try\u3011: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>restarting the game / creating a new save file / adjusting the ZOOM in settings.